# The settings' memory: a setting changed (here the key change on the SETTINGS page: HOME held) is kept in flash a moment after, and is back at the next power-on;
# a setting of an effect too (the Flex page's quantize: SEL + FX walks to the last pages).
seed 0
wait 3000
press HOME
wait 900
release HOME
wait 100
expect fxpage 18
spin K1 2
# the screensaver: on the SCREEN page (0.16.1), the settings' eighth (0.16.4: SCREAM before it)
turn SELECT 7
wait 100
expect fxpage 31
spin K2 1
wait 6000
expect keyset 2
reboot
wait 6500
expect keyset 2
expect saver 1
